{"seq":4,"slug":"major-works","title":"曾国藩·major-works","stage":"DONE","category":"zeng-guofan","categoryLabel":"曾国藩","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zeng-guofan/major-works","rating":{"composite":3.69,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/27_zeng-guofan/4_major-works","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"曾国藩-主要著作\">曾国藩·主要著作</h1><p>曾国藩（1811—1872）留下的文字，跨越家书、日记、奏折、古文与编选选本，最终汇为《曾文正公全集》。本 hub 从&quot;著述&quot;这一角度切入曾国藩——不是讲他做了什么（事功），也不是讲他主张什么（思想），而是讲他<strong>写了什么、这些文字如何成书、如何流传、又当如何辨真伪与读法</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-与兄弟-hub-的分工\">本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工</h2><p>曾国藩条目下共六个 hub，各有侧重，本 hub 是&quot;文本与文献&quot;的入口：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>兄弟 hub</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n<th>与本 hub 的关系</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"life-and-times/\">生平与时代</a></td>\n<td>他的一生经历</td>\n<td>著述是生平的产物</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"core-contributions/\">核心贡献</a></td>\n<td>他做成了什么事</td>\n<td>奏折是事功的实录</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"ideas-and-methods/\">思想与方法</a></td>\n<td>他主张什么</td>\n<td>思想以著述为载体</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>主要著作（本 hub）</strong></td>\n<td><strong>他写了什么·如何流传</strong></td>\n<td><strong>文本与文献本身</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"influence-and-legacy/\">影响与遗产</a></td>\n<td>后世如何受其影响</td>\n<td>著述是影响的渠道</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"controversies-and-appraisal/\">争议与评价</a></td>\n<td>如何评价他</td>\n<td>评价须回到文本</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>简言之：读思想去 hub 3，读文本来 hub 4。本 hub 反复强调一条原则——读曾国藩须回到《全集》原文，警惕伪托与失真。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-的章节结构\">本 hub 的章节结构</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    I[主要著作] --&gt; C1[1 家书]&#10;    I --&gt; C2[2 日记·文章·奏折]&#10;    I --&gt; C3[3 编纂与流传]&#10;    C1 --&gt; A1[成书与版本]&#10;    C1 --&gt; A2[主题与智慧]&#10;    C2 --&gt; B1[曾国藩日记]&#10;    C2 --&gt; B2[文章与奏折]&#10;    C3 --&gt; D1[嘉言与格言]&#10;    C3 --&gt; D2[编纂著作与全集流传]\">flowchart TD\n    I[主要著作] --&gt; C1[1 家书]\n    I --&gt; C2[2 日记·文章·奏折]\n    I --&gt; C3[3 编纂与流传]\n    C1 --&gt; A1[成书与版本]\n    C1 --&gt; A2[主题与智慧]\n    C2 --&gt; B1[曾国藩日记]\n    C2 --&gt; B2[文章与奏折]\n    C3 --&gt; D1[嘉言与格言]\n    C3 --&gt; D2[编纂著作与全集流传]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>章节</th>\n<th>篇目</th>\n<th>范围</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1 家书</td>\n<td><a href=\"the-family-letters/a-classic-of-instruction\">成书与版本</a></td>\n<td>文献学：成书、版本、规模</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td><a href=\"the-family-letters/themes-and-wisdom\">主题与智慧</a></td>\n<td>治学·修身·治家·处世四主题</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2 日记与文章</td>\n<td><a href=\"diaries-and-writings/the-diaries\">曾国藩日记</a></td>\n<td>求阙斋日记·修身实录</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td><a href=\"diaries-and-writings/essays-and-memorials\">文章与奏折</a></td>\n<td>古文造诣·经世公文·辨伪托</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3 编纂与流传</td>\n<td><a href=\"compiled-wisdom/maxims-and-sayings\">嘉言与格言</a></td>\n<td>名句出处·本义·失真辨析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td><a href=\"compiled-wisdom/books-compiled\">编纂与全集流传</a></td>\n<td>杂钞诗钞·全集·曾国藩热</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><ul>\n<li>前置：建议先浏览 <a href=\"life-and-times/\">生平与时代</a>，知道道光、咸丰、同治三朝的大致经历，读著述时才有时间坐标。</li>\n<li>大众读者：<a href=\"the-family-letters/a-classic-of-instruction\">家书成书</a> → <a href=\"the-family-letters/themes-and-wisdom\">家书主题</a> → <a href=\"compiled-wisdom/maxims-and-sayings\">嘉言格言</a>，三篇即可建立对最流行文本的可靠认识。</li>\n<li>研究取向：加读 <a href=\"diaries-and-writings/the-diaries\">日记</a> 与 <a href=\"diaries-and-writings/essays-and-memorials\">文章奏折</a>，再到 <a href=\"compiled-wisdom/books-compiled\">全集流传</a> 掌握文献版本，最后对照 <a href=\"controversies-and-appraisal/\">争议与评价</a> 形成判断。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>读完本 hub，应能区分&quot;曾国藩亲笔&quot;与&quot;后人附会&quot;，知道各类著述的版本与读法，并理解为何在全部文字中唯独家书一枝独秀。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-family-letters","title":"The Family Letters","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zeng-guofan/major-works/the-family-letters","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"a-classic-of-instruction","title":"《曾国藩家书》：成书、版本与文献结构","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zeng-guofan/major-works/the-family-letters/a-classic-of-instruction"},{"seq":2,"slug":"themes-and-wisdom","title":"家书的主题与智慧：治学、修身、治家、处世","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zeng-guofan/major-works/the-family-letters/themes-and-wisdom"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"diaries-and-writings","title":"Diaries And Writings","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zeng-guofan/major-works/diaries-and-writings","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-diaries","title":"《曾国藩日记》：求阙斋日记与修身功夫的实录","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zeng-guofan/major-works/diaries-and-writings/the-diaries"},{"seq":2,"slug":"essays-and-memorials","title":"文章与奏折：作为文章大家与经世之才的曾国藩","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zeng-guofan/major-works/diaries-and-writings/essays-and-memorials"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"compiled-wisdom","title":"Compiled Wisdom","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zeng-guofan/major-works/compiled-wisdom","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"maxims-and-sayings","title":"嘉言与格言：曾国藩名句的出处、含义与流传","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zeng-guofan/major-works/compiled-wisdom/maxims-and-sayings"},{"seq":2,"slug":"books-compiled","title":"编纂的著作与全集流传：从《经史百家杂钞》到《曾文正公全集》","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zeng-guofan/major-works/compiled-wisdom/books-compiled"}]}]}